<title>POLAND: VISTULA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.04 vs   2.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.56 vs   3.47</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.12 vs   1.49</p>
<p> Sales		   10.06 vs   9.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.94 vs   4.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.31 vs   6.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.24 vs   3.92</p>
<p> Sales		   28.50 vs  24.76</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Odziezowego Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
